@page "/"
@layout AuthLayout

<PageTitle>Safe Passage – Identity &amp; Device Security</PageTitle>

<div class="landing-page">
    <header class="landing-header">
        <a class="landing-brand" href="/" aria-label="Safe Passage home">
            <span class="landing-brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/favicon.png" alt="" /></span>
            <span>Safe Passage</span>
        </a>
        <nav class="landing-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
            <a href="#platform">Platform</a>
            <a href="#plans-billing">Plans &amp; billing</a>
            <a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
        </nav>
        <div class="landing-account-links"><a class="landing-signin" href="/login">Sign in</a><a class="landing-join" href="/signup">Create account</a></div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="landing-hero">
            <div class="landing-hero-copy">
                <div class="landing-kicker"><span></span> IDENTITY, DEVICES &amp; SAVED ACCESS</div>
                <h1>Every access point.<br /><span>One safe passage.</span></h1>
                <p class="landing-intro">Manage accounts, trusted devices, saved applications, and sign-in activity in one place. Safe Passage helps users protect saved logins and gives administrators tools to review access.</p>
                <div class="landing-actions">
                    <a class="landing-primary" href="/signup">Create your account <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
                    <a class="landing-secondary" href="/login">Already a member? Sign in</a>
                    <a class="landing-secondary" href="/downloads/safepassage-extension.zip" download="safepassage-extension.zip">Download Browser Extension</a>
                    <a class="landing-secondary" href="/downloads/safepassage-mobile.apk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Download Android APK</a>
                </div>
                <div class="landing-note"><span class="landing-note-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> Built for visibility, control, and safer access.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="landing-visual" aria-label="Preview of the Safe Passage user dashboard">
                <div class="visual-orbit orbit-one"></div>
                <div class="visual-orbit orbit-two"></div>
                <div class="visual-glow"></div>
                <div class="visual-card">
                    <div class="visual-topbar"><span class="visual-brand-dot"></span><span>SAFE PASSAGE</span><span class="visual-live"><i></i> USER DASHBOARD</span></div>
                    <div class="visual-heading"><div><small>YOUR ACCOUNT</small><strong>Dashboard</strong></div><span class="visual-calendar">Refresh</span></div>
                    <div class="visual-stats">
                        <div><small>ASSIGNED APPLICATIONS</small><strong>03</strong><span>Active access granted</span></div>
                        <div><small>PENDING REQUESTS</small><strong>01</strong><span>Track requests</span></div>
                        <div><small>SUBSCRIPTION PLAN</small><strong>—</strong><span>Manage plan</span></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="visual-event-title"><strong>Your Applications</strong><span>VIEW ALL</span></div>
                    <div class="visual-event"><span class="visual-app-dot"></span><span><b>Figma</b><small>Design and collaboration</small></span><i class="event-ok">LAUNCH ↗</i></div>
                    <div class="visual-event"><span class="visual-app-dot"></span><span><b>Google Workspace</b><small>Productivity</small></span><i class="event-ok">LAUNCH ↗</i></div>
                    <div class="visual-event"><span class="visual-app-dot"></span><span><b>Slack</b><small>Messaging and collaboration</small></span><i class="event-ok">LAUNCH ↗</i></div>
                </div>
                <div class="visual-floating"><span>✦</span><div><b>Protected sign-ins</b><small>Mobile approval for saved logins</small></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="landing-scroll"><span></span> SCROLL TO EXPLORE</div>
        </section>

        <section class="landing-platform" id="platform">
            <div class="section-heading">
                <div class="landing-kicker"><span></span> THE PLATFORM</div>
                <h2>Access your apps.<br /><span>Protect your logins.</span></h2>
                <p>Use Safe Passage to find your applications, keep saved credentials in sync, and approve protected sign-ins from a trusted mobile device.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="landing-features">
                <article class="feature-card">
                    <span class="feature-icon feature-blue" aria-hidden="true">◎</span>
                    <small>01 / APPLICATIONS</small>
                    <h3>Find your applications</h3>
                    <p>Open applications assigned to you, discover eligible apps, and track access requests.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="feature-card">
                    <span class="feature-icon feature-teal" aria-hidden="true">▣</span>
                    <small>02 / CREDENTIAL VAULT</small>
                    <h3>Keep logins in sync</h3>
                    <p>Save website logins and optional 2FA secrets in the web vault or extension and keep them in sync.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="feature-card">
                    <span class="feature-icon feature-violet" aria-hidden="true">⌁</span>
                    <small>03 / BROWSER EXTENSION</small>
                    <h3>Autofill after approval</h3>
                    <p>Detect sign-in fields and fill saved credentials on verified sites after mobile approval.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="feature-card">
                    <span class="feature-icon feature-amber" aria-hidden="true">≋</span>
                    <small>04 / MOBILE APPROVAL</small>
                    <h3>Confirm protected sign-ins</h3>
                    <p>Approve administrator sign-ins and authorize the extension to use saved credentials on a trusted device.</p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="landing-billing" id="plans-billing" aria-labelledby="landing-billing-title">
            <div class="section-heading">
                <div class="landing-kicker"><span></span> PLANS &amp; BILLING</div>
                <h2 id="landing-billing-title">Subscription &amp; Billing</h2>
                <p>Review plan options, security capabilities, and the billing history available in the Safe Passage user dashboard.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="billing-dashboard-preview">
                <div class="billing-preview-heading">
                    <div><small>USER DASHBOARD</small><h3>Subscription &amp; Billing</h3></div>
                    <span>ACCOUNT OVERVIEW</span>
                </div>
                <div class="billing-overview-grid">
                    <article class="billing-preview-card billing-current-plan">
                        <div class="billing-card-label">CURRENT PLAN</div>
                        <div class="billing-current-title"><strong>Free</strong><span>ACTIVE</span></div>
                        <div class="billing-current-price">PHP 0 <small>/ month</small></div>
                        <p>Core device-bound MFA for individuals getting started with zero-trust access.</p>
                        <div class="billing-renewal-note">No payment is required for the Free plan.</div>
                    </article>
                    <article class="billing-preview-card">
                        <div class="billing-available-heading"><h3>Available Plans</h3><span>PLAN OPTIONS</span></div>
                        <div class="billing-plan-option">
                            <div><strong>Pro Annual</strong><small>All Pro features, billed annually</small></div>
                            <b>PHP 2,990 <small>/ year</small></b>
                        </div>
                        <div class="billing-plan-option">
                            <div><strong>Pro Monthly</strong><small>More devices, saved websites, and activity history</small></div>
                            <b>PHP 299 <small>/ month</small></b>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                </div>
                <article class="billing-preview-card billing-tiers-card">
                    <div class="billing-available-heading"><h3>Plan Features</h3><span>PLAN COMPARISON</span></div>
                    <div class="billing-tiers-grid">
                        <div class="billing-tier">
                            <div class="billing-tier-heading"><strong>Free</strong><span>STARTER</span></div>
                            <b>PHP 0 <small>/ month</small></b>
                            <ul><li>Mobile MFA sign-in approvals</li><li>Up to 2 trusted devices</li><li>Up to 5 saved websites with autofill</li><li>7-day sign-in activity history</li></ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="billing-tier billing-tier-pro">
                            <div class="billing-tier-heading"><strong>Pro</strong><span>MONTHLY OR ANNUAL</span></div>
                            <b>From PHP 299 <small>/ month</small></b>
                            <ul><li>Unlimited trusted devices and saved websites</li><li>Authenticator code generation in the extension</li><li>90-day sign-in activity history</li><li>All Free features</li></ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="billing-tier billing-tier-enterprise">
                            <div class="billing-tier-heading"><strong>Enterprise</strong><span>PLANNED</span></div>
                            <b>Organization plan</b>
                            <ul><li>Feature set and pricing to be announced</li><li>Not available for checkout yet</li></ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <article class="billing-preview-card billing-history-preview">
                    <div class="billing-available-heading"><h3>Billing &amp; Receipt History</h3><span>ACCOUNT RECORDS</span></div>
                    <p>Subscription receipts and billing records are available in the user dashboard after signing in.</p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="landing-capabilities" aria-labelledby="capabilities-title">
            <div class="section-heading">
                <div class="landing-kicker"><span></span> FOR APPLICATION OWNERS</div>
                <h2 id="capabilities-title">Access controls for administrators.</h2>
                <p>Bring application access, device requirements, and security review into the same workflow.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="capability-grid">
                <article class="capability-card">
                    <span class="capability-number">01</span>
                    <h3>Connect your applications</h3>
                    <p>Configure applications for OpenID Connect sign-in, with callback URLs and client settings managed in Safe Passage.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="capability-card">
                    <span class="capability-number">02</span>
                    <h3>Set device requirements</h3>
                    <p>Define access rules for trusted devices, screen locks, and device integrity, then review each device’s reported status.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="capability-card">
                    <span class="capability-number">03</span>
                    <h3>Review access requests</h3>
                    <p>Let users request access to eligible applications and give administrators a place to review those requests.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="capability-card">
                    <span class="capability-number">04</span>
                    <h3>Follow security events</h3>
                    <p>Review recorded sign-in activity, denied attempts, and newly registered devices from the administrator portal.</p>
                </article>
            </div>
            <div class="capability-cta">
                <div><strong>Approvals happen on a trusted device.</strong><span>Enroll a phone to receive and approve administrator sign-in requests.</span></div>
                <a href="https://safepassage-mobile.vercel.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Safe Passage Mobile <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="landing-how" id="how-it-works">
            <div class="how-copy">
                <div class="landing-kicker"><span></span> A CLEARER WAY TO MANAGE ACCESS</div>
                <h2>From identity<br />to trusted access.</h2>
                <p>Safe Passage connects everyday account administration with device awareness and sign-in verification—so your team can act with a better view of what’s happening.</p>
                <a class="how-link" href="/signup">Create a Safe Passage account <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            </div>
            <div class="how-steps">
                <div class="how-step"><span>01</span><div><b>Manage identities</b><p>Keep account and role administration in one place.</p></div><i>→</i></div>
                <div class="how-step"><span>02</span><div><b>Connect trusted devices</b><p>Enroll mobile devices and review their status.</p></div><i>→</i></div>
                <div class="how-step"><span>03</span><div><b>Review access activity</b><p>Use sign-in approvals and recorded events to stay informed.</p></div><i>✓</i></div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="landing-footer">
        <a class="landing-brand" href="/" aria-label="Safe Passage home">
            <span class="landing-brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/favicon.png" alt="" /></span>
            <span>Safe Passage</span>
        </a>
        <span>Identity &amp; device security, with a clearer view.</span>
        <a href="/login">Sign in <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </footer>
</div>

